{"unit_id":"lalilulelo3__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"lalilulelo3/dsh-notify","commit":"62a558bd53d478deaf17482b3f3a70e4d737f117","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Notify（DSH 插件，Windows 桌面通知）：在 Windows 上提醒你关注 DSH agent 的状态。它以宿主端插件监听会话事件和提问流程，使用系统 toast 展示通知并可播放默认提示音。主要功能有回合结束提醒、待回答问题提醒、待授权操作提醒，以及按原因筛选和静默子 agent 会话。适合运行长任务、暂时离开浏览器窗口时了解任务进度。需要 Windows 10 或 11、Node.js 20 以上和以 web profile 启动的 DSH；不需要 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:248-300","lib/index.js:236-239","cordis.patch.yml:21-23"]}
{"unit_id":"lalilulelo3__dsh-notify#card-en","repo":"lalilulelo3/dsh-notify","commit":"62a558bd53d478deaf17482b3f3a70e4d737f117","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Notify is a Windows desktop alert plugin for DSH. It listens for agent turn endings, questions, and approval requests, then shows a toast with optional sound. Useful for long tasks when away from the browser. Requires Windows 10/11, Node.js 20+, and DSH web profile; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:248-300","lib/index.js:236-239","cordis.patch.yml:21-23"]}
